px) {\n  .custom__html-block11 {\n    padding: 0 20px 20px;\n  }\n  .custom__html-block11 .block__content,\n  .custom__html-block11 .block__content-text {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .custom__html-block11 img {\n    margin-right: 0;\n  }\n  .custom__html-block11 .block__content-text .block__heading h3 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .custom__html-block11 .block__content-text .block__heading p {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .custom__html-block11::after {\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n}"}},"rich_text_UHKPdn":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_nLaxXj":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<b>Frequently asked questions<\/b>","heading_size":"h3"}}},"block_order":["heading_nLaxXj"],"settings":{"container":"container","color_scheme":"","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":0,"custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"page_faqs_jY7xLJ":{"type":"page-faqs","blocks":{"accordion_XiWthW":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"title":"What topics do you do have workshops on?","content":"<p>We at neOwn conduct a wide variety of skill-building workshops on: <\/p><ul><li>Creative Writing<\/li><li>Speech & Communication <\/li><li>Debate & Public Speaking<\/li><li>Math Skills<\/li><li>Coding & AI<\/li><li>Life Skills<\/li><li>Art & Design (including learning softwares like Canva, Photoshop, and more)<\/li><li>Music<\/li><\/ul>","open":false}},"accordion_wWxapm":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"title":"Are the neOwn workshops conducted online?","content":"<p>Yes! As of now, the neOwn workshops are conducted online as we have children from all over India participating in them. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_98FnHe":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"title":"Are the workshops only for neOwn customers?","content":"<p>No. Anyone in the appropriate age range can participate in the neOwn workshops. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_TjN8da":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"title":"Are these paid workshops?","content":"<p>Yes, they are paid workshops. <\/p><p>We do conduct free community sessions online like book exploration & storytelling, which you can attend by joining our parents’ community on WhatsApp (where Zoom link & other details will be shared). <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_fhEYkH":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"title":"What’s your workshop cancellation policy?","content":"<p>Refund will only be granted if the cancellation is done 24 hours before the workshop. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_JGFVja":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Is there any deposit or registration fee?","content":"<p>No, there is no deposit or registration fee. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_VUQPmJ":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Do I get to choose my books or do you send pre-curated books?","content":"<p>You can choose your books! If you require any help with selection, you can take recommendations from our in-house book expert. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_dXNAQy":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"There’s no place to enter my child’s details on the website, how will you know what kind of books I want?","content":"<p>Our app asks for all these details to create a profile for your child. <\/p><p>Once you subscribe to any plan, you have to log in to our neOwn App to select your books. <\/p><p>Before you can view the catalog on the app, you have to enter all your child’s details - including their age, so that we can provide an age-appropriate catalog for them. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_mXAMLA":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Can I get books for both my children in one library subscription, or do I need to subscribe to the ‘2 Siblings’ plan?","content":"<p>No, you cannot get books for both children in one library subscription. You can subscribe to the ‘2 Siblings’ plan to get books for both your children, where you can get 3 books for each child or 5 books for each child. The reason for this is that we create a unique profile for each child with all their details and provide an age-appropriate curated catalog of books to choose from. This will enable you to see each child’s unique progress as well as all the books they have read in a more organised manner. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_ikFw3k":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"How do you sanitize the books?","content":"<p>Our process to ensure the books are hygenic and in good condition: <\/p><ul><li>⁠We do a thorough check of all books twice - once after they have come back from customers and the second time before they are going to another customer <\/li><li>⁠⁠We also clean board books to ensure they are 100% sanitary <\/li><li>⁠⁠If any books are of bad quality we don't circulate them among customers anymore<\/li><\/ul>","open":false}},"accordion_HTJKXC":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"If I subscribe today, will my 30 days start now?","content":"<p>No, your 30 days will start after the books have been delivered to you. <\/p><p>Once you subscribe, you have to download our app to select your books. After selection, they will be delivered in 2-5 days within Mumbai and 4-8 days outside Mumbai. <\/p><p>Your 30 days start from the day when the books are delivered. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_MnkN7P":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What are the shipping charges for outstation?","content":"<p>The shipping charges for out-of-Mumbai deliveries are as follows: <\/p><p><strong>Plan Name<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Number of items per month <\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Outside Mumbai Shipping Charge <\/strong><\/p><p>Book Library (1 child)<\/p><p>5 books per month<\/p><p>₹150\/- per month<\/p><p>Book Library (2 siblings) (3+3 Plan)<\/p><p>3+3 (total 6) books per month <\/p><p>₹150\/- per month<\/p><p>Book Library (2 siblings) (5+5 Plan)<\/p><p>5+5 books (total 10) per month<\/p><p>₹200\/- per month<\/p><p>Currently our Toy Library is only being serviced in Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, & Thane. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_aTVRQj":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"My pin code is showing not serviceable. What do I do?","content":"<p>We may still be able to deliver to you! WhatsApp us at +91 9137081640 and let us know your pin code, we’ll inform you if your area is serviceable. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_79wQzC":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"How do I return the Library books?","content":"<p>Once you are done reading the books, you can select ‘Done Reading’ on our app. Then you have to select your next set of books. Once the next set is confirmed, our team will schedule a delivery for the new items and a pickup to return the old books. The return process is as follows: We’ll send our delivery partner directly to your doorstep for the pickup of the books. You’ll be notified of the timelines, and you can keep the books packed for when it's time for the pickup.<\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_Rp6NhE":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Do you have other languages books?","content":"<p>Yes! We also have a limited collection of books in Hindi, Marathi, and Gujarati. <\/p>","open":false}},"accordion_MrqUic":{"type":"accordion","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Can I cancel the Library Subscription at any time?","content":"<p>At this time, we do not offer order cancellation.<\/p><p>In case you’re facing any problems or are unhappy with your subscription, we’d love to hear what you would like us to change or improve! WhatsApp us on 9137081640, or you can get in touch directly with our founder at kranti@neown.in.<\/p>","open":false}}},"block_order":["accordion_XiWthW","accordion_wWxapm","accordion_98FnHe","accordion_TjN8da","accordion_fhEYkH","accordion_JGFVja","accordion_VUQPmJ","accordion_dXNAQy","accordion_mXAMLA","accordion_ikFw3k","accordion_HTJKXC","accordion_MnkN7P","accordion_aTVRQj","accordion_79wQzC","accordion_Rp6NhE","accordion_MrqUic"],"settings":{"headingsec":"","container":"container","color_scheme":"","menu":"","custom_class":""}}},"order":["slider_GrccVh","rich_text_gtPVCt","scrolling_promotion_XreH74","featured_collection_xR3dtk","rich_text_exfKfb","main","rich_text_E7VrcJ","new_featured_product_YYFpyk","new_featured_product_yfEYxn","new_featured_product_ttytDt","rich_text_HiYGL8","image_with_text_2_N3BJxG","image_with_text_ThLVCx","collection_list_fnNVwK","custom_liquid_dqH7GJ","brands_list_QmQiV9","featured_collection_RbGLcc","custom_content_TgWBnU","custom_code_fJGpmg","rich_text_UHKPdn","page_faqs_jY7xLJ"]}